00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.035 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey.
My name is Jay Jurden,

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:04.637 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I recently
went to the doctor.

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:08.308
I was diagnosed with a very rare
but a very treatable condition

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:11.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have what's known
as black best-friend face.

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:12.579 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:14.214 align:start size:94% position:6%
You see it?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:17.150 align:start size:94% position:6%
