black best friend in TV shows,

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:20.587 align:start size:94% position:6%
movies,
college campus brochures.

00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:23.556 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:25.191 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's me.

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:25.825 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
