00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:29.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm just happy and nappy
next to the science building

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:33.500 align:start size:94% position:6%
Doing my best to learn about
these electrons.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:34.067 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
