And with this personality.

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:41.574 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm also an actor,
and as an actor,

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:44.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
my job is very easy,
because whenever I audition,

00:00:44.144 --> 00:00:49.149
