00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:52.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
..."Yo, my mama
would never let me do that

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:55.422 align:start size:94% position:6%
but you need to get out ther
and dance"...

00:00:55.422 --> 00:00:56.056 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.056 --> 00:01:01.594
..."Excuse me,
but what the hell...is a scone?"

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:04.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
And --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:06.232 align:start size:94% position:6%
For the record,
I know what a scone is.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:06.900 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I love scones.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.536
People say, "Jay, you want
to become a famous actor?

00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:12.305
Move out to Los Angeles?
Start dating white women?"

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:14.908 align:start size:94% position:6%
And to those people, I say
"Women? Hoo!

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:17.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
You must think
I'm a really good actor."

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:19.145 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:26.286 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:27.487 line:92%
I like making people smile

00:01:27.487 --> 00:01:29.589 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's so many
beautiful smiles out there

00:01:29.589 --> 00:01:31.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
including, but not limited to,
my own.

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:34.627
Yes.
Natural smile, never had braces.

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:36.930 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right.
He did this.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:40.433
I'm talking about the big
orthodontist in the sky.

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:43.203 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's as if God said,
"Your teeth will be straight

00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:44.671 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
