00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:55.582
Speaking of religion, my Dad's
side of the family is Catholic

00:01:55.582 --> 00:01:57.917 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right --
black Catholics do exist.

00:01:57.917 --> 00:02:00.854 line:92%
We say "Hail Mary J. Blige."

00:02:00.854 --> 00:02:03.156 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:06.025 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Full of grace
in this dancerie."

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:11.264 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:14.200 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now, I'm not straight,
but I do like straight people.

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:17.570 align:start size:94% position:6%
In fact, straight people,
make some noise!

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:19.038 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's enough.

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:20.006 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:22.175 line:92%
We can't take y'all nowhere.

00:02:22.175 --> 00:02:24.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
I did something kind of drasti
this past fall

00:02:24.444 --> 00:02:26.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
