six other dudes --"

00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:48.001 line:92%
I said, "Stop right there.

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:48.801 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:51.437 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I already said yes."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:53.506 line:92%
No need to sweeten the deal.

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:54.374 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:55.542 line:92%
Turns out I was mistaken.

00:02:55.542 --> 00:02:57.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
As you guys all know,
